# Llamadas de ejemplo a la API. Funciona con la extension "REST Client" de
# VS Code y con el cliente HTTP de Rider, Visual Studio e IntelliJ.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jperez",
  "password": "123456"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Ordenes del tecnico 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workorders?technicianId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ordenes pendientes del tecnico 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workorders?technicianId=1&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar el estado de la orden 4
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/workorders/4/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
